#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0210 expect=skipped domain=SE
#note "SEUPDES column absent while row 1 codes ETCD='UNPLAN'. Requirements.Variables.All [ETCD, SEUPDES] now gates the rule out -> auditable skip naming the column instead of a violation carried by the bare empty(SEUPDES) leaf (absent = all-missing, EC-43). Verdict 2-1 (T1-37): the absence is itself reportable, and the minted sister CDISC-CG9674 reports it ONCE for this dataset. SUPERSEDES the 2026-08-27 rationale for REMOVING the gate ('no rule anywhere reports its absence') - the sister is exactly that rule, which is what the removal was missing."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset SE label="Subject Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SESEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | SE | 01-701-1015 | 1 | UNPLAN |
